  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">ECOWAS: &quot;Trade Negotiation Capacity Building&quot;  Projektet syftar till att st&#xE4;rka den handelspolitiska kompetensen b&#xE5;de inom ECOWAS&apos; medlemsstater och inom organisationen genom utbildning av f&#xF6;rhandlare, workshops ministerm&#xF6;ten och f&#xF6;rst&#xE4;rkning av ECOWAS&apos; sekreteriat. Period: 2004-2007. Budget: SEK 11 800 000</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">ECOWAS: &quot;Trade Negotiation Capacity Building&quot;  The objetive of the project is to strengthen the capacity in the area of trade policy in ECOWAS&apos; member states as well as within ECOWAS&apos; organization through training of negotiators, workshops, ministerial meetings and strengthening of ECOWAS&apos; Secretariat. Period: 2004-2007. Budget: SEK 11 800 000.</narrative>
  </description>
